       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.

       PROGRAM-ID.     CARBCATPF.
       AUTHOR.         EXLTECH, LLC - DAN RAUCH

      ***************************************************************
      **                 C A R B C A T P F
      ***************************************************************
      **         ARIBA CATALOG PREFERRED ITEM RETRIEVAL
      **       -------------------------------------------
      ** THIS SUBROUTINE GETS THE PREFERRED CATALOG ITEM PER PASSED
      ** CORP CODE USING THREE DIFFERENT MODES OF OPERATION:
      **
      **   MODE = 1  RETRIEVES THE PREFERRED CATALOG ITEM - THIS
      **             MAY BE THE PREFERRED ITEM BECAUSE IT HAS THE
      **             LOWEST PRICE -OR- IT MAY BE AN OVERRIDE ITEM
      **             IF ONE EXISTS.
      **
      **   NOTE => OVERRIDE ITEM 1ST -IF NFND- THEN LOWEST PRICE ITEM.
      **   ------------------------------------------------------------
      **   MODE = 2  RETRIEVES ONLY THE PREFERRED CATALOG ITEM - THIS
      **             ITEM IS SIMPLY THE LOWEST PRICE CATALOG ITEM
      **             FOR CORP CODE PASSED - REGARDLESS OF OVERRIDE
      **   ------------------------------------------------------------
      **   MODE = 3  RETRIEVES ONLY THE OVERRIDE CATALOG ITEM FOR THE
      **             CORP CODE PASSED, IF ONE EXISTS OR RETURNS NFND.
      **   ------------------------------------------------------------
      **
      **   ONLY FILE STATUS CODES "00" OR "23" ARE RETURNED
      **       -------------------------------------------
      **   USE COPY MEMBERS ZCATPWS AND ZCATPSUBR IN CALLER PROGRAMS
      **
      *****************************************************************
      *** NOTE:  LOGICAL MCFLAB2003 IS KEYED BY CORPCODE AND PRICE,
      *** THEREFORE THE LOWEST PRICE ITEM IS ALWAYS THE 1ST RECORD
      *** WITHIN EACH CORP CODE GROUP
      ***************************************************************
      * Modification History:                                       *
      ***************************************************************
      *                                                             *
      *    Date     Name             Description                    *
      * ----------  ---------------  ------------------------------ *
      * mm/dd/yyyy                                                  *
      ***************************************************************


      *================================================================
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
      *===============================================================
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.

       SOURCE-COMPUTER.       IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.       IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.         LOCAL-DATA LDA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT CATALOG-OVRD-FILE  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLAB2702
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS IS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.

           SELECT CATALOG-FILE  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLAB2003
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS IS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  WITH DUPLICATES.

      *================================================================
       DATA DIVISION.
      *================================================================
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  CATALOG-OVRD-FILE.
       01  CATALOG-OVRD-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLAB2702.
       COPY DARIBAOVR IN COPYLIB.

       FD  CATALOG-FILE.
       01  CATALOG-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLAB2003.
       COPY DARIBACAT IN COPYLIB.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY FILESTATUS IN COPYLIB.

      *****************************************************************
      *  MISCELLANEOUS WORK FIELDS
      *****************************************************************
       01  WS-PROGRAM-MESSAGES.
           03  WS-INVALID-MODE-MSG PIC  X(80)      VALUE
               "INVALID MODE - MUST BE 1, 2 OR 3".

           03  WS-INVALID-CC-MSG   PIC  X(80)      VALUE
               "INVALID CORP CODE - NOT FOUND IN ARIBA BUYER CATALOG".

           03  WS-INVALID-OVR-MSG  PIC  X(80)      VALUE
               "INVALID CORP CODE - OVERRIDE ITEM NOT FOUND".

       01  WS-MISCELLANEOUS-FIELDS.
           03  WS-PROGRAM-NAME     PIC  X(10)      VALUE "CARBCATPF".
           03  WS-MSSG             PIC  X(80)      VALUE SPACE.

      *================================================================
      *=             L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N
      *================================================================
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LS-CORP-CODE            PIC X(08).
       01  LS-MODE                 PIC X(01).
       01  LS-CATREC               PIC X(400).
       01  LS-STATUS               PIC X(02).
       01  LS-MSSG                 PIC X(80).

      *================================================================
      *=             P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N
      *================================================================
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING  LS-CORP-CODE  LS-MODE  LS-CATREC
                                 LS-STATUS  LS-MSSG.
       0000-PROGRAM-ENTRY.

           OPEN  INPUT  CATALOG-OVRD-FILE
                        CATALOG-FILE.

           PERFORM 0010-INITIALIZE       THRU 0010-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE

           WHEN LS-MODE = "1"
               PERFORM 1000-MODE-1       THRU 1000-MODE-1-EXIT

           WHEN LS-MODE = "2"
               PERFORM 1000-MODE-2       THRU 1000-MODE-2-EXIT

           WHEN LS-MODE = "3"
               PERFORM 1000-MODE-3       THRU 1000-MODE-3-EXIT

           END-EVALUATE.

           MOVE WS-MSSG                TO LS-MSSG.
           MOVE BUF-DARIBCAT           TO LS-CATREC.
           MOVE WS-FILE-STATUS         TO LS-STATUS.

           CLOSE        CATALOG-OVRD-FILE
                        CATALOG-FILE.


       0000-PROGRAM-END.
           GOBACK.

      *****************************************************************
      ** 1ST TIME PROCESSING ROUTINE
      *****************************************************************
       0010-INITIALIZE.

           INITIALIZE BUF-DARIBCAT.
           MOVE WS-INVALID-MODE-MSG    TO WS-MSSG.
           SET FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND  TO TRUE.

       0010-EXIT.
            EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      ***  THIS ROUTINE GETS THE PREFERRED ITEM FOR A GIVEN CORP CODE
      ***  THIS ITEM MAY BE PREFERRED BY OVERRIDE -OR- LOWEST PRICE
      *****************************************************************
       1000-MODE-1.

           MOVE SPACE                  TO WS-MSSG.
           PERFORM 9100-READK-CATALOG-OVRD  THRU 9100-READK-EXIT.
           IF  FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
               PERFORM 9000-START-CATALOG   THRU 9000-START-EXIT
               PERFORM 9000-READN-CATALOG   THRU 9000-READN-EXIT
               IF  FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
                   MOVE WS-INVALID-CC-MSG    TO WS-MSSG
               END-IF
           END-IF.

       1000-MODE-1-EXIT.
            EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      ***  THIS ROUTINE GETS THE PREFERRED ITEM FOR A GIVEN CORP CODE
      ***  BASED SOLELY ON THE LOWEST CATALOG PRICE FOR THAT ITEM
      ***  --  REGARDLESS OF WHETHER AN ITEM OVERRIDE EXISTS --
      *****************************************************************
       1000-MODE-2.

           MOVE SPACE                  TO WS-MSSG.
           PERFORM 9000-START-CATALOG   THRU 9000-START-EXIT.
           PERFORM 9000-READN-CATALOG   THRU 9000-READN-EXIT.
           IF  FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
               MOVE WS-INVALID-CC-MSG    TO WS-MSSG
           END-IF.

       1000-MODE-2-EXIT.
            EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      ***  THIS ROUTINE GETS THE OVERRIDE ITEM FOR A GIVEN CORP CODE
      *****************************************************************
       1000-MODE-3.

           MOVE SPACE                  TO WS-MSSG.
           PERFORM 9100-READK-CATALOG-OVRD  THRU 9100-READK-EXIT.
           IF  FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
               MOVE WS-INVALID-OVR-MSG   TO WS-MSSG
           END-IF.

       1000-MODE-3-EXIT.
            EXIT.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *
      *            ALL DATABASE FILE I-O'S BELOW THIS POINT
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------

      *****************************************************************
      ***  START CATALOG  FILE
      *****************************************************************
       9000-START-CATALOG.

           INITIALIZE BUF-DARIBCAT.

           MOVE LS-CORP-CODE       TO ARIBACAT-CORP-CODE.
           MOVE ZERO               TO ARIBACAT-CONVER-PRICE

           START CATALOG-FILE
                 KEY IS >= EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
           END-START.

       9000-START-EXIT.
            EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      *** READ CATALOG FILE SEQUENTIALLY
      *** ------------------------------------------------------------
      *** NOTE:  LOGICAL MCFLAB2003 IS KEYED BY CORPCODE AND PRICE,
      *** THEREFORE THE LOWEST PRICE ITEM IS ALWAYS THE 1ST RECORD
      *** WITHIN EACH CORP CODE GROUP
      *****************************************************************
       9000-READN-CATALOG.

           READ CATALOG-FILE NEXT RECORD
           END-READ.

           IF  FS-END-OF-FILE
               INITIALIZE BUF-DARIBCAT
               SET FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND  TO TRUE
               GO TO 9000-READN-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF  ARIBACAT-CORP-CODE NOT = LS-CORP-CODE
               INITIALIZE BUF-DARIBCAT
               SET FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND  TO TRUE
           END-IF.

       9000-READN-EXIT.
            EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      ***  READK CATALOG OVERRIDE
      *****************************************************************
       9100-READK-CATALOG-OVRD.

           INITIALIZE BUF-DARIBOVR.
           MOVE LS-CORP-CODE TO ARIBAOVR-CORP-CODE.

           READ CATALOG-OVRD-FILE
           END-READ.

           IF  FS-GOOD-FILE-IO
               IF  ARIBAOVR-ACTIVE-FLAG = "Y"
                   MOVE BUF-DARIBOVR   TO  BUF-DARIBCAT
               ELSE
                   INITIALIZE BUF-DARIBOVR
                   SET  FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND  TO TRUE
               END-IF
           END-IF.

       9100-READK-EXIT.
            EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
      **                  END  OF  SOURCE  MEMBER
      *****************************************************************
